  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CISST F&#xe5;ngarnas m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter-2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CISST Human rights of prisoners-2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CISST aims to contribute is to bring the prison conditions in T&#xfc;rkiye closer to human rights and universal values. The prerequisites for this long-term change are that the responsible bodies, particularly the Ministry of Justice, fulfil their responsibilities stemming from international human rights standards more vigorously to make T&#xfc;rkiye a country where rights violations in prisons are effectively prevented and prisoners enjoy their human rights in full, and the stakeholders and advocates act more actively to protect the human rights of prisoners when the aforementioned bodies fail to fulfil their responsibilities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CISST:s verksamhet syftar till att bidra till att f&#xf6;ra f&#xe4;ngelsef&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llandena i Turkiet mer i linje med m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och universella v&#xe4;rden. F&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningarna f&#xf6;r denna l&#xe5;ngsiktiga f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndring &#xe4;r att de ansvariga organen, s&#xe4;rskilt justitieministeriet, uppfyller sina &#xe5;taganden fr&#xe5;n internationella m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsstandarder s&#xe5; att Turkiet kan bli ett land d&#xe4;r r&#xe4;ttighetskr&#xe4;nkningar i f&#xe4;ngelser effektivt f&#xf6;rhindras och f&#xe5;ngar &#xe5;tnjuter sina m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i sin helhet, samt att advokater och andra relevanta akt&#xf6;rer mer aktivt skyddar f&#xe5;ngars m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter om de tidigare n&#xe4;mnda organen inte fullg&#xf6;r sina skyldigheter.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the contribution is defined as:

CISST aims to contribute is to bring the prison conditions in T&#xfc;rkiye closer to human rights and universal values. The prerequisites for this long-term change are that the responsible bodies, particularly the Ministry of Justice, fulfil their responsibilities stemming from international human rights standards more vigorously to make T&#xfc;rkiye a country where rights violations in prisons are effectively prevented and prisoners enjoy their human rights in full, and the stakeholders and advocates act more actively to protect the human rights of prisoners when the aforementioned bodies fail to fulfil their responsibilities. 

The interventions outcomes are:

-Owing to the increased awareness and empowerment of the community of prisoners and their families, more and more prisoners are able to make use of a wider range of their rights.

-More diverse non-governmental actors take action to defend and improve human rights in prisons.

-The attitude of the key actors to take action against violation of prisoners rights and for improving prison conditions have improved positively owing to civil monitoring, advocacy and dialogue by CISST.

-CISST has carried on its institutionalization and has become more resilient and sustainable by maintaining its impact power for improving human rights in the prison system.</narrative>
  </description>
